/P 217 0 R
/E (In the US and Europe there is poor understanding of the distinct needs and contexts in the Global South leading to generalisations and partial, biased views of the impacts of technology on society, as well as a poor predisposition to hear best practices and lessons learned from Global South or Majority World countries. Furthermore, debates in this area show limited openness to non-European and external perspectives.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [13]
>>
