/P 217 0 R
/E (These factors undermine an otherwise interesting and one-of-a-kind legislation like the DSA and limit the possibility of making good use of it elsewhere. Moreover, they impact the ability of Europe itself to foresee and guard against unintended consequences of the implementation and development of this regulation, even within their own region.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [14]
>>
