/E (For Europeans, the advantages are clearer as they are the intended beneficiaries of this legislation. They will also have a first-mover advantage in testing and framing the interpretation of these provisions, and even if the tool is not as efficient, it will certainly provide a better understanding of platforms than the one they have now.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [1]
